controlledburn (Rust)
Copyright 2026 Michael Sumner

A pure Rust port of the C++ core of controlledburn
(https://github.com/hypertidy/controlledburn), Copyright 2025 Michael
Sumner, Apache License 2.0.

The modules under src/ee/ are derived from the exactextract library
(https://github.com/isciences/exactextract), Copyright 2018-2022
ISciences, LLC, Apache License 2.0: axis-aligned box side and crossing
logic, perimeter-distance parameterisation, area measures, grid
indexing (shrink-to-fit and cell boxes, in src/grid.rs) and the
left-hand-area chain chasing algorithm.

The approx-mode scanline (src/approx.rs) and the pixel reduction
functions in src/materialize.rs derive, through the C++ core, from the
fasterize R package (https://github.com/ecohealthalliance/fasterize),
